  "notes": "{細|ほそ}い is an i-adjective meaning thin, slender, or narrow.\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverb: {細|ほそ}く\n- Noun form: {細|ほそ}さ (thinness)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n⟦{太|ふと}い→太い：02955_futoi⟧ (thick, fat, wide)\n- {細|ほそ}い: physically thin/narrow (objects, roads, limbs)\n- ⟦{薄|うす}い→薄い：00764_usui⟧: thin in thickness (paper, walls)\n- ⟦{痩|や}せている→痩せる：01146_yaseru⟧: thin (body weight, person)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{細|ほそ}い: narrow road\n- {細|ほそ}い⟦{指|ゆび}→指：01518_yubi⟧: slender fingers\n- {細|ほそ}い⟦{線|せん}→線：09901_sen⟧: thin line\n- ⟦{声|こえ}→声：02207_koe⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{細|ほそ}い: weak/thin voice\n- ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{細|ほそ}い: narrow eyes\n- {細|ほそ}い⟦{体|からだ}→体：00784_karada⟧: slender body\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{細長|ほそなが}い→細長い：06670_hosonagai⟧: long and thin",
